{
  "id": "demo-mv-winter-peak",
  "name": "Vision MV – winter evening peak",
  "description": "A cold January week on the Vision MV network: household demand +10 % for heat pumps plus two cohorts of evening EV home charging. Look at the Violations tab and the loading views between 17 and 21 h: LS transformers and feeder cable R1 overload every evening, and KNP 1 (LS), behind the high-impedance transformer 78, drops below 0.95 pu. The reactive-power edits on the LV loads are deliberate: they give the loads power factor 0.97 (the network file has q = 0).",
